If you want the picks returned in a simple, consistent layout, just use this little JSON shape in your reply:

{
  "solution": [<selected_item>, <selected_item>, ...]
}

Think of "solution" as the list of exactly m products to put in the display — each entry is a product identifier from the instance. This block is just a sketch of the shape I expect, not the final answer itself.

All identifiers must be used exactly as they appear in the instance input — no renaming and no new labels.

Valid identifiers look like plain numbers such as “1” or “23”, single capital letters like “A” or “B”, or a capital letter followed by digits like “A1” or “X7”.
